{"at": "2026-09-27T05:13:14.257700+00:00", "event_id": "01M3GMG6RHD33HKH347TF17RF4", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M3GM893605F3W7C36KJZZ9M8", "input_key": "acceptance_criteria", "mission_id": "01M3GKZ8BMNDRS6K7PWXNHFHE4", "mission_slug": "review-feedback-to-implementer-01M3GKZ8", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": [], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "What acceptance criteria define done for the feedback pipeline fix?", "recorded_at": "2026-09-27T05:13:14.257700Z", "run_id": "01M3GM893605F3W7C36KJZZ9M8", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-27T05:08:54.502454Z", "step_id": "specify.acceptance.criteria"}}
{"at": "2026-09-27T05:13:51.759275+00:00", "event_id": "01M3GMHBCFFVA67P4468TKVFVX", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M3GM87CM2TDF2666PT61A2N4", "final_answer": "Explicitly out of scope: #4327 (summary-attribute CLI wiring, off critical path, possibly SaaS-gated); #5007 (issue-matrix approval gating); #4809 (arbiter-override moment drop \u2014 but the write-side change must not regress it); #3563 (frozen, deferred retirement). Conditional fold: #3451 (review-cycle counter double-increment) folds into the write-side work ONLY IF it reproduces on the new in_progress rejection edge; otherwise it stays out of scope.", "mission_id": "01M3GKZ8BMNDRS6K7PWXNHFHE4", "mission_slug": "review-feedback-to-implementer-01M3GKZ8", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-27T05:13:51.759275Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M3GM87CM2TDF2666PT61A2N4", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-27T05:13:51.751385Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-09-27T05:13:53.262250+00:00", "event_id": "01M3GMHCVE77TXPM2ECVJTQD41", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M3GM893605F3W7C36KJZZ9M8", "final_answer": "Done requires four issue-pinned, red-first regression scenarios: (1) the in_review-to-in_progress rejection edge produces the same durable feedback record as the in_review-to-planned edge (committed review-cycle artifact + set feedback path + resolvable reference); (2) a no-rationale rejection on that edge is refused; (3) a fix-mode prompt-regeneration failure emits a visible warning and never a silent feedback-less prompt; (4) persisted feedback renders into the regenerated implementer prompt on both single_branch and coord topologies. No version numbers in scope.", "mission_id": "01M3GKZ8BMNDRS6K7PWXNHFHE4", "mission_slug": "review-feedback-to-implementer-01M3GKZ8", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-27T05:13:53.262250Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M3GM893605F3W7C36KJZZ9M8", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-27T05:13:53.255876Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-09-27T05:14:02.493463+00:00", "event_id": "01M3GMHNVX61HTKZR2DX17GSV9", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M3GM85PM3D5R1FT5TRW8F1Z3", "final_answer": "In scope: issues #4899 and #5024 only. (#4899) The rejection edge that moves a work package from in_review to in_progress must produce the SAME durable feedback record as the in_review-to-planned edge \u2014 a committed review-cycle artifact, a set feedback path, and a resolvable reference \u2014 and a rejection carrying no rationale on that edge must be refused. (#5024) Once feedback is persisted, the regenerated implementer prompt must carry it; a fix-mode prompt-regeneration failure must emit a visible warning instead of silently falling back to a feedback-less prompt, and feedback must render into the regenerated prompt on both single-branch and coordination topologies. The existing synthetic-marker/resolvable-pointer vocabulary is reused unchanged.", "mission_id": "01M3GKZ8BMNDRS6K7PWXNHFHE4", "mission_slug": "review-feedback-to-implementer-01M3GKZ8", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-27T05:14:02.493463Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M3GM85PM3D5R1FT5TRW8F1Z3", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-27T05:14:02.485233Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
